 "cues": [
  {
   "start": 0,
   "end": 4.96,
   "text": "Hi, and welcome."
  },
  {
   "start": 4.81,
   "end": 10.42,
   "text": "I'm happy you made the choice to meditate today."
  },
  {
   "start": 10.27,
   "end": 19.46,
   "text": "Before we start, just take a second to get yourself comfortable."
  },
  {
   "start": 19.31,
   "end": 22.96,
   "text": "Maybe you\u2019re sitting on the couch."
  },
  {
   "start": 22.81,
   "end": 28.04,
   "text": "Maybe you\u2019re on a pillow or lying down on your bed."
  },
  {
   "start": 27.89,
   "end": 32.82,
   "text": "There\u2019s no right or wrong position here."
  },
  {
   "start": 32.67,
   "end": 39.62,
   "text": "Just choose whatever feels good for you."
  },
  {
   "start": 39.47,
   "end": 48.74,
   "text": "Take a look around you, and then, when you\u2019re ready, let your eyes close."
  },
  {
   "start": 48.59,
   "end": 53.56,
   "text": "Or keep them open if that feels more comfortable."
  },
  {
   "start": 53.41,
   "end": 59.06,
   "text": "You don\u2019t have to do anything special right now."
  },
  {
   "start": 58.91,
   "end": 65.56,
   "text": "You don\u2019t have to clear your mind or stop your thoughts."
  },
  {
   "start": 65.41,
   "end": 74.4,
   "text": "Just give yourself a few quiet minutes to slow down."
  },
  {
   "start": 74.25,
   "end": 82.74,
   "text": "Feel the place where your body is touching the surface underneath you, below you."
  },
  {
   "start": 82.59,
   "end": 87.74,
   "text": "Notice that you\u2019re supported."
  },
  {
   "start": 87.59,
   "end": 92.76,
   "text": "Let your shoulders drop a little."
  },
  {
   "start": 92.61,
   "end": 95.4,
   "text": "Relax your hands."
  },
  {
   "start": 95.25,
   "end": 100.7,
   "text": "Let your body be comfortable."
  },
  {
   "start": 100.55,
   "end": 110.0,
   "text": "And now, take a slow breath in\u2026"
  },
  {
   "start": 109.85,
   "end": 115.02,
   "text": "And let it go."
  },
  {
   "start": 114.87,
   "end": 117.94,
   "text": "No need to force anything."
  },
  {
   "start": 117.79,
   "end": 121.86,
   "text": "Just breathe normally."
  },
  {
   "start": 121.71,
   "end": 127.0,
   "text": "Take one more slow breath in\u2026"
  },
  {
   "start": 126.85,
   "end": 134.7,
   "text": "And slowly breathe out."
  },
  {
   "start": 134.55,
   "end": 138.58,
   "text": "Today, we\u2019re going to imagine a peaceful,"
  },
  {
   "start": 138.43,
   "end": 154.4,
   "text": "quiet garden and learn two words we might use when we talk about it: \u201cshadow\u201d and \u201cshade.\u201d"
  },
  {
   "start": 154.25,
   "end": 158.96,
   "text": "Let's begin."
  },
  {
   "start": 158.81,
   "end": 162.66,
   "text": "Imagine, in your mind, a garden."
  },
  {
   "start": 162.51,
   "end": 166.5,
   "text": "It doesn't need to be a real place."
  },
  {
   "start": 166.35,
   "end": 173.58,
   "text": "Simply imagine whatever garden feels peaceful to you, full of soft green plants,"
  },
  {
   "start": 173.43,
   "end": 176.74,
   "text": "and quiet corners to rest."
  },
  {
   "start": 176.59,
   "end": 185.8,
   "text": "Picture yourself sitting somewhere in this garden, comfortable and calm."
  },
  {
   "start": 185.65,
   "end": 188.32,
   "text": "Maybe on a bench."
  },
  {
   "start": 188.17,
   "end": 190.84,
   "text": "Maybe on the grass."
  },
  {
   "start": 190.69,
   "end": 194.54,
   "text": "Whatever feels right."
  },
  {
   "start": 194.39,
   "end": 199.5,
   "text": "Imagine it\u2019s a very hot, sunny day."
  },
  {
   "start": 199.35,
   "end": 205.72,
   "text": "The sun is strong, and you want to get away from it."
  },
  {
   "start": 205.57,
   "end": 210.0,
   "text": "You might say to a friend, \u201cIt\u2019s too hot."
  },
  {
   "start": 209.85,
   "end": 214.12,
   "text": "Let\u2019s find some shade.\u201d"
  },
  {
   "start": 213.97,
   "end": 221.88,
   "text": "Shade is an area that is protected from the direct sunlight."
  },
  {
   "start": 221.73,
   "end": 234.34,
   "text": "A tree can provide shade, and you can sit or stand in the shade to get away from the sun."
  },
  {
   "start": 234.19,
   "end": 238.78,
   "text": "Look around this garden."
  },
  {
   "start": 238.63,
   "end": 245.44,
   "text": "Imagine that there are lots of plants here that like the shade."
  },
  {
   "start": 245.29,
   "end": 253.94,
   "text": "They grow well because they are protected from the strong sunlight."
  },
  {
   "start": 253.79,
   "end": 258.6,
   "text": "Take a slow breath in\u2026"
  },
  {
   "start": 258.45,
   "end": 264.16,
   "text": "and breathe out."
  },
  {
   "start": 264.01,
   "end": 272.56,
   "text": "Imagine yourself sitting comfortably in the shade of a tree."
  },
  {
   "start": 272.41,
   "end": 278.62,
   "text": "Now, look down at the ground."
  },
  {
   "start": 278.47,
   "end": 284.36,
   "text": "Can you see the dark shape made by the tree?"
  },
  {
   "start": 284.21,
   "end": 289.9,
   "text": "That is its shadow."
  },
  {
   "start": 289.75,
   "end": 297.7,
   "text": "A shadow is a dark shape made when something blocks the sunlight."
  },
  {
   "start": 297.55,
   "end": 302.14,
   "text": "You can see your shadow on the ground."
  },
  {
   "start": 301.99,
   "end": 307.46,
   "text": "Maybe you\u2019re standing next to a friend, and notice that your shadow is taller than theirs."
  },
  {
   "start": 307.31,
   "end": 312.5,
   "text": "You could say, \u201cLook at my shadow!"
  },
  {
   "start": 312.35,
   "end": 317.4,
   "text": "It\u2019s taller than yours.\u201d"
  },
  {
   "start": 317.25,
   "end": 323.26,
   "text": "Shade is a cool area protected from direct sunlight,"
  },
  {
   "start": 323.11,
   "end": 333.35,
   "text": "while a shadow is the dark shape made when something blocks the light."
  },
  {
   "start": 333.2,
   "end": 337.96,
   "text": "Take another slow breath in\u2026"
  },
  {
   "start": 337.81,
   "end": 344.16,
   "text": "and breathe out."
  },
  {
   "start": 344.01,
   "end": 350.2,
   "text": "You are sitting in the shade, protected from the sun,"
  },
  {
   "start": 350.05,
   "end": 357.6,
   "text": "while the tree\u2019s shadow rests on the ground beside you."
  },
  {
   "start": 357.45,
   "end": 360.74,
   "text": "Notice how peaceful this garden feels."
  },
  {
   "start": 360.59,
   "end": 363.72,
   "text": "No rush."
  },
  {
   "start": 363.57,
   "end": 366.02,
   "text": "No noise."
  },
  {
   "start": 365.87,
   "end": 373.5,
   "text": "Just quiet green plants, gentle sunlight, and this comfortable,"
  },
  {
   "start": 373.35,
   "end": 378.56,
   "text": "cool shade surrounding you."
  },
  {
   "start": 378.41,
   "end": 384.96,
   "text": "Let your body feel just as calm as this garden."
  },
  {
   "start": 384.81,
   "end": 392.46,
   "text": "Let your breath move just as gently as the breeze through the leaves."
  },
  {
   "start": 392.31,
   "end": 394.64,
   "text": "Take a breath in\u2026"
  },
  {
   "start": 394.49,
   "end": 403.38,
   "text": "and let it out slowly."
  },
  {
   "start": 403.23,
   "end": 409.92,
   "text": "This garden will always be here, whenever you need it."
  },
  {
   "start": 409.77,
   "end": 415.94,
   "text": "A quiet place to sit, protected in the shade,"
  },
  {
   "start": 415.79,
   "end": 421.82,
   "text": "watching the shadows move gently across the ground."
  },
  {
   "start": 421.67,
   "end": 429.94,
   "text": "Let these gentle words settle into your mind."
  },
  {
   "start": 429.79,
   "end": 437.68,
   "text": "I can rest in this quiet, peaceful place."
  },
  {
   "start": 437.53,
   "end": 445.54,
   "text": "I am protected, like sitting in gentle shade."
  },
  {
   "start": 445.39,
   "end": 456.82,
   "text": "I am calm, like a shadow resting quietly on the ground."
  },
  {
   "start": 456.67,
   "end": 459.6,
   "text": "I am safe."
  },
  {
   "start": 459.45,
   "end": 464.04,
   "text": "I am at peace."
  },
  {
   "start": 463.89,
   "end": 472.36,
   "text": "Take another slow breath, and let these words settle a little deeper."
  },
  {
   "start": 472.21,
   "end": 478.64,
   "text": "Stay here for a while longer, resting in this imagined garden,"
  },
  {
   "start": 478.49,
   "end": 487.62,
   "text": "feeling the shade around you, and watching the shadow move softly nearby."
  },
  {
   "start": 487.47,
   "end": 493.26,
   "text": "There's no need to rush away from this feeling."
  },
  {
   "start": 493.11,
   "end": 505.08,
   "text": "Let yourself stay here, calm and comfortable, for as long as you'd like."
  },
  {
   "start": 504.93,
   "end": 516.69,
   "text": "When you feel ready, begin to bring awareness back to the room around you gently."
  },
  {
   "start": 516.54,
   "end": 520.76,
   "text": "Notice the surface beneath you."
  },
  {
   "start": 520.61,
   "end": 529.59,
   "text": "Notice your breath, still slow, still steady."
  },
  {
   "start": 529.44,
   "end": 536.26,
   "text": "Let your fingers move first, just slightly."
  },
  {
   "start": 536.11,
   "end": 538.98,
   "text": "Then your toes."
  },
  {
   "start": 538.83,
   "end": 546.82,
   "text": "Small movements, gentle and unhurried."
  },
  {
   "start": 546.67,
   "end": 551.42,
   "text": "Take your time returning."
  },
  {
   "start": 551.27,
   "end": 557.06,
   "text": "There's no hurry."
  },
  {
   "start": 556.91,
   "end": 569.64,
   "text": "Whenever you're ready, let your eyes open softly, taking in the light around you."
  },
  {
   "start": 569.49,
   "end": 577.0,
   "text": "Carry this quiet garden with you into the rest of your day."
  },
  {
   "start": 576.85,
   "end": 588.18,
   "text": "Whenever you need a moment of peace, remember this place, this shade, this shadow,"
  },
  {
   "start": 588.03,
   "end": 600.14,
   "text": "resting quietly, always here, waiting for you to return."
  },
  {
   "start": 599.99,
   "end": 602.9,
   "text": "You are calm."
  },
  {
   "start": 602.75,
   "end": 607.72,
   "text": "You are at peace."
  },
  {
   "start": 607.57,
   "end": 643.0,
   "text": "And you are exactly where you need to be."
  }
 ]
}

