   "text": "Imagine you\u2019re opening the door and walking into a cozy clothing store."
  },
  {
   "start": 26.89,
   "end": 28.72,
   "text": "Listen."
  },
  {
   "start": 28.57,
   "end": 65.06,
   "text": "You can hear the soft sounds of the store around you."
  },
  {
   "start": 64.91,
   "end": 86.76,
   "text": "You slowly walk past the racks of clothes."
  },
  {
   "start": 86.61,
   "end": 117.78,
   "text": "A rack is a structure where clothes hang in the store."
  },
  {
   "start": 117.63,
   "end": 131.0,
   "text": "You stop and look at a few jackets."
  },
  {
   "start": 130.85,
   "end": 135.36,
   "text": "You gently run your hand over the fabric."
  },
  {
   "start": 135.21,
   "end": 153.5,
   "text": "There is a beautiful leather jacket that catches your eye."
  },
  {
   "start": 153.35,
   "end": 158.88,
   "text": "To catch your eye \u2014 in the past, caught your eye \u2014"
  },
  {
   "start": 158.73,
