   "text": "means to attract your attention because you notice or like something."
  },
  {
   "start": 191.63,
   "end": 207.72,
   "text": "You take the jacket off the rack and look at the tag."
  },
  {
   "start": 207.57,
   "end": 214.16,
   "text": "A tag is a small label attached to clothing that usually shows"
  },
  {
   "start": 214.01,
   "end": 221.92,
   "text": "information like the size or price."
  },
  {
   "start": 221.77,
   "end": 230.22,
   "text": "It\u2019s your size."
  },
  {
   "start": 230.07,
   "end": 245.72,
   "text": "You decide to try it on."
  },
  {
   "start": 245.57,
   "end": 281.46,
   "text": "To try something on means to put on clothes to see how they look or fit."
  },
  {
   "start": 281.31,
   "end": 304.64,
   "text": "You walk toward the fitting room."
  },
  {
   "start": 304.49,
   "end": 326.42,
   "text": "You step inside, close the door, and slowly put on the jacket."
  },
  {
   "start": 326.27,
   "end": 326.92,
   "text": "Listen."
  },
  {
   "start": 326.71,
   "end": 350.64,
   "text": "You can hear the quiet sounds of the store outside."
  },
  {
   "start": 350.49,
   "end": 386.16,
   "text": "You look at yourself in the mirror, and you love it."
  },
  {
   "start": 386.01,
   "end": 389.86,
   "text": "Take a slow breath in\u2026"
  },
  {
   "start": 389.71,
   "end": 424.32,
   "text": "and breathe out\u2026"
  },
  {
   "start": 424.17,
   "end": 450.58,
   "text": "You change back into your clothes and leave the fitting room."
  },
  {
   "start": 450.43,
   "end": 472.98,
   "text": "You walk to the self-checkout and place the jacket down."
  },
  {
   "start": 472.83,
   "end": 499.7,
   "text": "The self-checkout is the place where you scan and pay for your items yourself."
