 "cues": [
  {
   "start": 0,
   "end": 10.3,
   "text": "Let your eyes close, gently, like a curtain closing at the end of a quiet day."
  },
  {
   "start": 10.15,
   "end": 20.2,
   "text": "Or, if you prefer, let them rest softly, looking down, unfocused."
  },
  {
   "start": 20.05,
   "end": 25.44,
   "text": "For these next few minutes, there's nothing you need to do,"
  },
  {
   "start": 25.29,
   "end": 29.54,
   "text": "and nothing you need to think about."
  },
  {
   "start": 29.39,
   "end": 32.24,
   "text": "Just this."
  },
  {
   "start": 32.09,
   "end": 38.24,
   "text": "Just you, resting here."
  },
  {
   "start": 38.09,
   "end": 43.24,
   "text": "Feel the surface beneath you, supporting you completely."
  },
  {
   "start": 43.09,
   "end": 55.12,
   "text": "Notice your body sinking a little, becoming heavier, more still."
  },
  {
   "start": 54.97,
   "end": 58.16,
   "text": "Take a slow breath in\u2026"
  },
  {
   "start": 58.01,
   "end": 63.24,
   "text": "and let it out."
  },
  {
   "start": 63.09,
   "end": 64.56,
   "text": "One more."
  },
  {
   "start": 64.41,
   "end": 67.14,
   "text": "In\u2026"
  },
  {
   "start": 66.99,
   "end": 71.86,
   "text": "and out."
  },
  {
   "start": 71.71,
   "end": 73.96,
   "text": "Today,"
  },
  {
   "start": 73.81,
   "end": 83.72,
   "text": "we're going to bring our attention to two parts of the body that carry us through every single day,"
  },
  {
   "start": 83.57,
   "end": 87.28,
   "text": "often without much thanks."
  },
  {
   "start": 87.13,
   "end": 94.14,
   "text": "Your hands, and your feet."
  },
  {
   "start": 93.99,
   "end": 98.24,
   "text": "We rarely stop to notice them."
  },
  {
   "start": 98.09,
   "end": 108.56,
   "text": "They work quietly, constantly, holding things, carrying us, touching the world around us."
  },
  {
   "start": 108.41,
   "end": 114.1,
   "text": "Today, we'll give them the attention they deserve."
  },
  {
   "start": 113.95,
   "end": 118.24,
   "text": "Let's begin with your hands."
  },
  {
   "start": 118.09,
   "end": 121.18,
   "text": "Bring your awareness there now."
  },
  {
   "start": 121.03,
   "end": 129.88,
   "text": "Notice how they feel, resting, doing nothing at all."
  },
  {
   "start": 129.73,
   "end": 137.14,
   "text": "In the center of each hand, there is a part called the palm."
  },
  {
   "start": 136.99,
   "end": 142.32,
   "text": "Your palm is the soft, inside surface of your hand,"
  },
  {
   "start": 142.17,
   "end": 148.48,
   "text": "the inside part of your hand where your fingers begin."
  },
  {
   "start": 148.33,
   "end": 153.82,
   "text": "Bring your attention to your palms now."
  },
  {
   "start": 153.67,
   "end": 158.24,
   "text": "Notice if they feel warm, or cool."
  },
  {
   "start": 158.09,
   "end": 165.48,
   "text": "Notice if they feel open, or slightly closed."
  },
  {
   "start": 165.33,
   "end": 173.9,
   "text": "Imagine, for a moment, that your palms are resting in warm sunlight."
  },
  {
   "start": 173.75,
   "end": 184.18,
   "text": "Feel this warmth spreading slowly across them, soft and comforting."
  },
  {
   "start": 184.03,
   "end": 189.16,
   "text": "Let your palms soften completely."
  },
  {
   "start": 189.01,
   "end": 201.2,
   "text": "Let them feel open, relaxed, asking for nothing, holding nothing."
  },
  {
   "start": 201.05,
   "end": 207.6,
   "text": "Notice your fingers too, resting beside your palms."
  },
  {
   "start": 207.45,
   "end": 216.18,
   "text": "Let them curl, ever so slightly, the way they naturally want to do."
  },
  {
   "start": 216.03,
   "end": 220.12,
   "text": "Your hands have touched so many things."
  },
  {
   "start": 219.97,
   "end": 222.28,
   "text": "Held so many things."
  },
  {
   "start": 222.13,
   "end": 231.64,
   "text": "And right now, they can simply rest, empty, and calm."
  },
  {
   "start": 231.49,
   "end": 242.1,
   "text": "Take a slow breath in, and imagine that breath moving all the way down into your palms."
  },
  {
   "start": 241.95,
   "end": 252.54,
   "text": "Breathe out, and feel your palms grow even softer, even heavier."
  },
  {
   "start": 252.39,
   "end": 260.0,
   "text": "Now, let's move our attention down to your feet."
  },
  {
   "start": 259.85,
   "end": 268.09,
   "text": "At the bottom of each foot, there is a part called the sole."
  },
  {
   "start": 267.94,
   "end": 272.74,
   "text": "Your sole is the underside of your foot,"
  },
  {
   "start": 272.59,
   "end": 279.98,
   "text": "the part that touches the ground every time you walk, every time you stand."
  },
  {
   "start": 279.83,
   "end": 284.4,
   "text": "Bring your awareness there now."
  },
  {
   "start": 284.25,
   "end": 290.64,
   "text": "Notice your soles, resting against the surface beneath you,"
  },
  {
   "start": 290.49,
   "end": 298.3,
   "text": "or resting gently in the air if your feet are raised."
  },
  {
   "start": 298.15,
   "end": 306.08,
   "text": "Think about everything your feet carry you through, every single day."
  },
  {
   "start": 305.93,
   "end": 313.18,
   "text": "Every step, every place you've walked, every doorway you've crossed."
  },
  {
   "start": 313.03,
   "end": 320.44,
   "text": "Your soles have felt the ground beneath countless moments of your life,"
  },
  {
   "start": 320.29,
   "end": 327.02,
   "text": "and they rarely receive a single thought of gratitude."
  },
  {
   "start": 326.87,
   "end": 335.08,
   "text": "Let's give them that thought now."
  },
  {
   "start": 334.93,
   "end": 345.46,
   "text": "Imagine warm sand beneath your soles, soft and fine, still warm from the afternoon sun."
  },
  {
   "start": 345.31,
   "end": 353.12,
   "text": "Feel the gentle weight of it, pressing softly against your skin."
  },
  {
   "start": 352.97,
   "end": 357.3,
   "text": "Let your soles soften completely."
  },
  {
   "start": 357.15,
   "end": 368.3,
   "text": "Let any tightness there melt slowly away, sinking into that warm, soft sand."
  },
  {
   "start": 368.15,
   "end": 376.72,
   "text": "Take a slow breath in, sending your awareness down into your feet."
  },
  {
   "start": 376.57,
   "end": 388.36,
   "text": "Breathe out, and let your soles feel completely at rest, heavy, and calm."
  },
  {
   "start": 388.21,
   "end": 398.46,
   "text": "Notice now, both your palms and your soles, resting quietly."
  },
  {
   "start": 398.31,
   "end": 407.78,
   "text": "Your palms, facing gently upward or resting softly at your sides."
  },
  {
   "start": 407.63,
   "end": 417.7,
   "text": "Your soles, resting against the ground, or floating gently in stillness."
  },
  {
   "start": 417.55,
   "end": 423.52,
   "text": "These two parts of your body rarely touch each other,"
  },
  {
   "start": 423.37,
   "end": 427.84,
   "text": "rarely share the same kind of attention."
  },
  {
   "start": 427.69,
   "end": 441.3,
   "text": "But right now, in this moment, they are both completely relaxed, both completely still."
  },
  {
   "start": 441.15,
   "end": 444.44,
   "text": "Let this stillness spread."
  },
  {
   "start": 444.29,
   "end": 451.7,
   "text": "From your palms, up through your arms, into your shoulders."
  },
  {
   "start": 451.55,
   "end": 458.74,
   "text": "From your soles, up through your legs, into your hips."
  },
  {
   "start": 458.59,
   "end": 466.24,
   "text": "Meeting somewhere in the middle, in your chest, where your breath continues,"
  },
  {
   "start": 466.09,
   "end": 474.74,
   "text": "slow and steady, in and out."
  },
  {
   "start": 474.59,
   "end": 480.38,
   "text": "Notice how connected your whole body feels right now."
  },
  {
   "start": 480.23,
   "end": 484.68,
   "text": "Every part playing its role."
  },
  {
   "start": 484.53,
   "end": 492.5,
   "text": "Every part, right now, simply resting."
  },
  {
   "start": 492.35,
   "end": 498.32,
   "text": "There's something quietly beautiful about hands and feet."
  },
  {
   "start": 498.17,
   "end": 504.82,
   "text": "They ask for so little, and yet they carry us through everything."
  },
  {
   "start": 504.67,
   "end": 512.56,
   "text": "Every hug we give, every step we take, begins with them."
  },
  {
   "start": 512.41,
   "end": 519.1,
   "text": "Today, let this be a small thank you."
  },
  {
   "start": 518.95,
   "end": 528.66,
   "text": "A few quiet minutes of rest, for parts of you that rarely stop working."
  },
  {
   "start": 528.51,
   "end": 536.6,
   "text": "Let these gentle words settle into your mind."
  },
  {
   "start": 536.45,
   "end": 542.72,
   "text": "My palms are open, and calm."
  },
  {
   "start": 542.57,
   "end": 549.42,
   "text": "My soles are soft, and supported."
  },
  {
   "start": 549.27,
   "end": 557.98,
   "text": "My body carries me gently, through each day."
  },
  {
   "start": 557.83,
   "end": 563.66,
   "text": "I am grateful for this body."
  },
  {
   "start": 563.51,
   "end": 570.46,
   "text": "I am completely at rest."
  },
  {
   "start": 570.31,
   "end": 580.22,
   "text": "Take another slow breath, and let these words settle deeper."
  },
  {
   "start": 580.07,
   "end": 584.5,
   "text": "Stay here a little longer,"
  },
  {
   "start": 584.35,
   "end": 591.58,
   "text": "noticing this quiet connection between your hands and your feet."
  },
  {
   "start": 591.43,
   "end": 594.14,
   "text": "Both resting."
  },
  {
   "start": 593.99,
   "end": 596.39,
   "text": "Both still."
  },
  {
   "start": 596.24,
   "end": 602.33,
   "text": "Both completely at peace."
  },
  {
   "start": 602.18,
   "end": 607.13,
   "text": "There's no need to rush away from this feeling."
  },
  {
   "start": 606.98,
   "end": 618.15,
   "text": "Let it stay with you for as long as you'd like, this sense of your whole body, cared for,"
  },
  {
   "start": 618.0,
   "end": 622.29,
   "text": "and calm."
  },
  {
   "start": 622.14,
   "end": 633.87,
   "text": "When you feel ready, and only when you feel ready, begin to bring a little movement back."
  },
  {
   "start": 633.72,
   "end": 640.11,
   "text": "Not quickly, just a small awakening."
  },
  {
   "start": 639.96,
   "end": 645.03,
   "text": "Notice your palms first."
  },
  {
   "start": 644.88,
   "end": 656.99,
   "text": "Let your fingers stretch out, slowly, like they're waking up after a long, peaceful rest."
  },
  {
   "start": 656.84,
   "end": 660.41,
   "text": "Then notice your soles."
  },
  {
   "start": 660.26,
   "end": 671.97,
   "text": "Let your toes move gently, just slightly, feeling the surface beneath them once again."
  },
  {
   "start": 671.82,
   "end": 679.01,
   "text": "Take a breath in, and let it fill your whole body."
  },
  {
   "start": 678.86,
   "end": 687.63,
   "text": "Breathe out, slow and complete."
  },
  {
   "start": 687.48,
   "end": 699.57,
   "text": "Whenever you're ready, let your eyes open softly, taking in the light around you."
  },
  {
   "start": 699.42,
   "end": 708.77,
   "text": "Before you continue with your day, take one more moment."
  },
  {
   "start": 708.62,
   "end": 713.33,
   "text": "Look at your hands, if you can."
  },
  {
   "start": 713.18,
   "end": 716.25,
   "text": "Notice your palms."
  },
  {
   "start": 716.1,
   "end": 726.81,
   "text": "Think about everything they've done for you, and everything they'll continue to do."
  },
  {
   "start": 726.66,
   "end": 731.65,
   "text": "And remember, even when you're standing,"
  },
  {
   "start": 731.5,
   "end": 740.71,
   "text": "even when you're walking through your busiest moments, your soles are still there,"
  },
  {
   "start": 740.56,
   "end": 748.63,
   "text": "quietly supporting you, one step at a time."
  },
  {
   "start": 748.48,
   "end": 752.99,
   "text": "Carry this small awareness with you."
  },
  {
   "start": 752.84,
   "end": 765.71,
   "text": "A little gratitude, for two parts of you that ask for very little, and give so much."
  },
  {
   "start": 765.56,
   "end": 769.61,
   "text": "You are calm."
  },
  {
   "start": 769.46,
   "end": 774.13,
   "text": "You are supported."
  },
  {
   "start": 773.98,
   "end": 823.0,
   "text": "And you are exactly where you need to be."
  }
 ]
}

assets/content/episodes/c033/cues.json:
{
 "source": "faster-whisper small.en word timestamps aligned to script phrases",
 "matchedWords": 778,
 "scriptWords": 829,
 "cues": [
  {
   "start": 0.7,
   "end": 11.64,
   "text": "Hello, and welcome to this \u201clistening to the sounds around you meditation\u201d."
  },
  {
   "start": 11.49,
   "end": 18.26,
   "text": "Take a moment to get comfortable and relax."
  },
  {
   "start": 18.11,
   "end": 25.82,
   "text": "You can sit on the couch, sit on a pillow, or lie down on your bed."
  },
  {
   "start": 25.67,
   "end": 33.6,
   "text": "Find a position that feels comfortable for you today."
  },
  {
   "start": 33.45,
   "end": 38.7,
   "text": "There\u2019s no need to sit in a special position."
  },
  {
   "start": 38.55,
   "end": 46.12,
   "text": "Just let your body relax and take your time."
  },
  {
   "start": 45.97,
   "end": 51.04,
   "text": "When you\u2019re ready, you can gently close your eyes,"
  },
  {
   "start": 50.89,
   "end": 57.06,
   "text": "or simply look down and let your eyes relax."
  },
  {
   "start": 56.91,
   "end": 69.04,
   "text": "For the next few minutes, you don\u2019t need to go anywhere or do anything."
  },
  {
   "start": 68.89,
   "end": 82.17,
   "text": "Just stay here, take a slow breath, and focus on this moment."
  },
  {
   "start": 82.02,
   "end": 88.69,
   "text": "Feel the surface beneath you, holding you completely."
  },
  {
   "start": 88.54,
   "end": 91.31,
   "text": "Let your shoulders soften."
  },
  {
   "start": 91.16,
   "end": 96.54,
   "text": "Let your hands rest."
  },
  {
   "start": 96.39,
   "end": 102.18,
   "text": "Take a slow breath in\u2026"
  },
  {
   "start": 102.03,
   "end": 108.78,
   "text": "and let it out."
  },
  {
   "start": 108.63,
   "end": 110.22,
   "text": "Once more."
  },
  {
   "start": 110.07,
   "end": 110.72,
   "text": "In\u2026"
  },
  {
   "start": 110.49,
   "end": 120.06,
   "text": "and out."
  },
  {
   "start": 119.91,
   "end": 126.58,
   "text": "Today, we're going to explore two words that describe two different worlds,"
  },
  {
   "start": 126.43,
   "end": 133.04,
   "text": "the world outside of us, and the world within us."
  },
  {
   "start": 132.89,
   "end": 138.88,
   "text": "The first is surroundings."
  },
  {
   "start": 138.73,
   "end": 146.94,
   "text": "Surroundings are the people, places, and things around you."
  },
  {
   "start": 146.79,
   "end": 151.7,
   "text": "For example, when you sit in a quiet room,"
  },
  {
   "start": 151.55,
   "end": 159.86,
   "text": "the room and everything around you are your surroundings."
  },
  {
   "start": 159.71,
   "end": 166.26,
   "text": "The second is interior."
  },
  {
   "start": 166.11,
   "end": 177.02,
   "text": "\"Interior\" can mean the inside of you, your thoughts, feelings, or emotions."
  },
  {
   "start": 176.87,
   "end": 183.6,
   "text": "For example, meditation can help you pay attention to your interior world,"
  },
  {
   "start": 183.45,
   "end": 188.5,
   "text": "or what is happening inside you."
  },
  {
   "start": 188.35,
   "end": 198.7,
   "text": "Today, we'll move gently between these two worlds, simply by listening."
  },
  {
   "start": 198.55,
   "end": 203.52,
   "text": "Let's begin with your surroundings."
  },
  {
   "start": 203.37,
   "end": 214.75,
   "text": "Bring your attention to any sounds you can hear right now, outside of your body."
  },
  {
   "start": 214.6,
   "end": 217.37,
   "text": "Maybe something close to you."
  },
  {
   "start": 217.22,
   "end": 220.03,
   "text": "Maybe something far away."
  },
  {
   "start": 219.88,
   "end": 228.96,
   "text": "Maybe silence itself, which has its own quiet sound."
  },
  {
   "start": 228.81,
   "end": 232.7,
   "text": "Just listen."
  },
  {
   "start": 232.55,
   "end": 240.52,
   "text": "Notice these sounds as they come, and notice them as they disappear."
  },
  {
   "start": 240.37,
   "end": 244.16,
   "text": "There\u2019s nothing to identify."
  },
  {
   "start": 244.01,
   "end": 246.34,
   "text": "Nothing to name."
  },
  {
   "start": 246.19,
   "end": 254.81,
   "text": "Just simple, open listening."
  },
  {
   "start": 254.66,
   "end": 263.17,
   "text": "Notice how these sounds belong to your surroundings, existing outside of you,"
  },
  {
   "start": 263.02,
   "end": 271.9,
   "text": "independent of your thoughts, independent of your breath."
  },
  {
   "start": 271.75,
   "end": 279.06,
   "text": "Stay here for a moment, simply listening to your surroundings."
  },
  {
   "start": 278.91,
   "end": 295.87,
   "text": "Now, gently, let's shift your attention inward, to your interior."
  },
  {
   "start": 295.72,
   "end": 298.83,
   "text": "Notice your breath."
  },
  {
   "start": 298.68,
   "end": 307.29,
   "text": "This sound, this movement, belongs only to you."
  },
  {
   "start": 307.14,
   "end": 318.02,
   "text": "It exists inside your body, quiet and constant."
  },
  {
   "start": 317.87,
   "end": 324.64,
   "text": "Listen to your breath the way you listened to those sounds around you."
  },
  {
   "start": 324.49,
   "end": 337.25,
   "text": "Notice it as it comes, and notice it as it goes, again and again."
  },
  {
   "start": 337.1,
   "end": 342.41,
   "text": "This is your interior world."
  },
  {
   "start": 342.26,
   "end": 349.9,
   "text": "Quiet, and completely your own."
  },
  {
   "start": 349.75,
   "end": 352.47,
   "text": "Take a slow breath in\u2026"
  },
  {
   "start": 352.32,
   "end": 359.08,
   "text": "and out."
  },
  {
   "start": 358.93,
   "end": 364.72,
   "text": "Now, let's move gently back to your surroundings."
  },
  {
   "start": 364.57,
   "end": 368.66,
   "text": "Notice any sounds outside of you once again."
  },
  {
   "start": 368.51,
   "end": 373.0,
   "text": "The distant hum of something far away."
  },
  {
   "start": 372.85,
   "end": 376.96,
   "text": "The quiet stillness of the room."
  },
  {
   "start": 376.81,
   "end": 382.64,
   "text": "Whatever exists around you, right now."
  },
  {
   "start": 382.49,
   "end": 390.34,
   "text": "Notice how these sounds continue, whether you're listening or not."
  },
  {
   "start": 390.19,
   "end": 400.2,
   "text": "Your surroundings simply exist, patient and constant."
  },
  {
   "start": 400.05,
   "end": 407.36,
   "text": "Move your attention back inward now, to your interior."
  },
  {
   "start": 407.21,
   "end": 412.4,
   "text": "Notice your heartbeat, if you can feel it."
  },
  {
   "start": 412.25,
   "end": 417.2,
   "text": "Notice the quiet rhythm of your breath."
  },
  {
   "start": 417.05,
   "end": 426.48,
   "text": "Notice the stillness of your own thoughts, settling gently."
  },
  {
   "start": 426.33,
   "end": 434.5,
   "text": "This interior world is always with you, wherever you go,"
  },
  {
   "start": 434.35,
   "end": 440.7,
   "text": "wherever your surroundings might change."
  },
  {
   "start": 440.55,
   "end": 447.17,
   "text": "Let's practice moving between these two worlds a little more."
  },
  {
   "start": 447.02,
   "end": 452.93,
   "text": "Bring your awareness outward, to your surroundings."
  },
  {
   "start": 452.78,
   "end": 458.15,
   "text": "Listen carefully."
  },
  {
   "start": 458.0,
   "end": 467.63,
   "text": "And now, bring your awareness inward, to your interior."
  },
  {
   "start": 467.48,
   "end": 473.98,
   "text": "Listen just as carefully."
  },
  {
   "start": 473.83,
   "end": 481.84,
   "text": "Notice how both worlds exist, at the very same time."
  },
  {
   "start": 481.69,
   "end": 487.36,
   "text": "Your surroundings, full of sound, full of space."
  },
  {
   "start": 487.21,
   "end": 498.77,
   "text": "Your interior, quiet, personal, and steady."
  },
  {
   "start": 498.62,
   "end": 503.31,
   "text": "There's something valuable in noticing this difference."
  },
  {
   "start": 503.16,
   "end": 510.39,
   "text": "Often, our attention gets pulled entirely outward, toward our surroundings."
  },
  {
   "start": 510.24,
   "end": 515.78,
   "text": "We forget our interior world completely."
  },
  {
   "start": 515.63,
   "end": 526.68,
   "text": "Other times, we become so lost in our interior thoughts, we forget the world around us."
  },
  {
   "start": 526.53,
   "end": 535.28,
   "text": "Today, you've simply practiced noticing both, gently moving between them,"
  },
  {
   "start": 535.13,
   "end": 542.55,
   "text": "without needing to choose one over the other."
  },
  {
   "start": 542.4,
   "end": 550.87,
   "text": "Let your awareness rest now, somewhere between these two worlds."
  },
  {
   "start": 550.72,
   "end": 554.47,
   "text": "Aware of your surroundings."
  },
  {
   "start": 554.32,
   "end": 559.36,
   "text": "Aware of your interior."
  },
  {
   "start": 559.21,
   "end": 561.32,
   "text": "Both present."
  },
  {
   "start": 561.17,
   "end": 566.45,
   "text": "Both welcome."
  },
  {
   "start": 566.3,
   "end": 573.24,
   "text": "Let these gentle words settle into your mind."
  },
  {
   "start": 573.09,
   "end": 576.04,
   "text": "I am aware of my surroundings."
  },
  {
   "start": 575.89,
   "end": 584.71,
   "text": "I am aware of my interior."
  },
  {
   "start": 584.56,
   "end": 593.48,
   "text": "Both worlds exist, together, in this moment."
  },
  {
   "start": 593.33,
   "end": 595.68,
   "text": "I am calm."
  },
  {
   "start": 595.53,
   "end": 600.31,
   "text": "I am present."
  },
  {
   "start": 600.16,
   "end": 609.58,
   "text": "Take another slow breath, and let these words settle a little deeper."
  },
  {
   "start": 609.43,
   "end": 646.9,
   "text": "Stay here for a while longer, simply noticing both worlds, your surroundings,"
  },
  {
   "start": 646.75,
   "end": 647.4,
   "text": "and your interior, existing quietly, side by side."
  },
  {
   "start": 646.75,
   "end": 647.4,
   "text": "There's no need to choose between them."
  },
  {
   "start": 646.75,
   "end": 647.4,
   "text": "Both are part of your experience, right now, and always."
  },
  {
   "start": 646.75,
   "end": 652.16,
   "text": "When you feel ready, begin to bring a little more attention back to your surroundings."
  },
  {
   "start": 652.01,
   "end": 655.88,
   "text": "Notice the sounds around you."
  },
  {
   "start": 655.73,
   "end": 664.11,
   "text": "Notice the air, the space, the room you're sitting in."
  },
  {
   "start": 663.96,
   "end": 669.49,
   "text": "Let your fingers move first, just slightly."
  },
  {
   "start": 669.34,
   "end": 672.49,
   "text": "Then your toes."
  },
  {
   "start": 672.34,
   "end": 677.59,
   "text": "Small movements, gentle and unhurried."
  },
  {
   "start": 677.44,
   "end": 683.65,
   "text": "Take your time."
  },
  {
   "start": 683.5,
   "end": 691.05,
   "text": "There's no need to rush this return."
  },
  {
   "start": 690.9,
   "end": 704.17,
   "text": "Whenever you're ready, let your eyes open softly, taking in your surroundings once again."
  },
  {
   "start": 704.02,
   "end": 711.69,
   "text": "Carry this awareness with you, into the rest of your day."
  },
  {
   "start": 711.54,
   "end": 728.0,
   "text": "Notice, from time to time, both worlds, the sounds around you, and the quiet world within."
  },
  {
   "start": 727.85,
   "end": 730.8,
   "text": "You are calm."
  },
  {
   "start": 730.65,
   "end": 734.36,
   "text": "You are present."
  },
  {
   "start": 734.21,
   "end": 774.0,
   "text": "And you are exactly where you need to be."
  }
 ]
}
